sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Super-user
  participant UI as Gradio (app.py)
  participant D as _drive_agent_stream
  participant A as Strands Agent
  participant M as JNJClaudeGatewayModel
  participant G as J&J GenAI Gateway
  participant T as collibra_tools @tool
  participant MC as MCPClient → Atlassian MCP
  participant PG as Postgres

  U->>UI: message / starter button / Quick Prompt
  UI->>UI: set_session_context(user, session_id, region)
  UI->>A: _ensure_chat_agent(region)
  UI->>D: drive(prompt, chat_history)
  D->>A: stream_async(prompt)
  loop Agent event loop
    A->>M: stream(messages, tool_specs[46 local + 10 MCP], system_prompt)
    M->>G: POST /model/{model_id}/invoke (Anthropic "tools")
    alt gateway canned refusal only
      G-->>M: "Sorry, the model cannot answer…"
      M-->>D: reasoning event "retrying (n/N)…"
      M->>G: retry with backoff
    end
    G-->>M: content: text and/or tool_use blocks
    M-->>A: Converse-style stream events (toolUse / text)
    A-->>D: current_tool_use → nested "🛠️ Tool calls" row
    alt local tool
      A->>T: execute (e.g. get_dataset_definition)
      T-->>A: tool result (Collibra / Redshift / S3 / PG)
    else MCP tool
      A->>MC: call jira_search / jira_get_issue …
      MC-->>A: tool result
    else ask_user_for_input
      T-->>A: tool_context.interrupt(question, fields)
      A-->>D: result.stop_reason = "interrupt"
    end
  end
  A-->>D: data (final text) + result
  D-->>UI: chunked answer, status "Completed" / "Waiting for your input"
  UI->>PG: log_chat_turn(chat_history)
  UI->>UI: refresh_pending_changes → approvals panel
  opt Interrupt pending
    U->>UI: fill form, Submit answers
    UI->>D: stream_async([{interruptResponse:{interruptId, response}}])
    Note over A,T: Same agent instance resumes, so the tool re-runs and interrupt() returns the answers
  end
